{"timestamp": 1779388668.886106, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 10, "data": {"caller": "player_4", "reason": "Eve reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Alice"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779388668.886841, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 10, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779388675.605212, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I reported Alice\u2019s body in Electrical. My route was storage -> medbay -> electrical. I didn\u2019t actually run into any living players face-to-face this round. The only movement I saw was Frank leaving medbay toward storage around T7. When I got into Electrical, Alice was already dead there and I reported immediately."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388682.8623612, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I was in Upper Engine, went up to Oxygen, then came back to Upper Engine. I didn\u2019t see anyone at all this round, so I can\u2019t clear or accuse anybody. I also never went near Electrical, Medbay, or Storage. Eve\u2019s report location is Electrical, and the only useful info I can add is that I had no encounters on the upper-left side."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388693.15484, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I went navigation -> security -> weapons. The important thing: at T6 I saw Charlie enter Security from the Electrical side, and Alice\u2019s body was reported in Electrical. I then ended up in Weapons with Charlie. I didn\u2019t see Alice myself, and I didn\u2019t see Frank or Eve.\n\nSo Charlie definitely came from the direction of the body location shortly before the report. That doesn\u2019t prove it, but Charlie needs to explain what they saw in Electrical and why they came out of there."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388718.447946, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I was in Electrical early. Frank was there with me T2 through T4, and Alice entered Electrical from cafeteria at T3. Alice was alive in Electrical when I left \u2014 I did not see a body there. I went from Electrical toward Security, and Diana saw me enter Security at T6 from that side.\n\nSo yes, I came from Electrical, but the important part is Alice was alive when I left. The last person I personally saw with Alice in Electrical was Frank. Eve also says she saw Frank leaving Medbay toward Storage around T7, which is right near the Electrical/Medbay area after I had already gone to Security.\n\nI think Frank needs to explain exactly when he left Electrical and where Alice was when he left. Right now Frank has the most opportunity from my perspective."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388730.5355678, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Okay, let me lay out my route honestly: medbay -> electrical -> medbay -> storage. I was in Electrical T2-T5 area, yes, with Charlie and then Alice. Charlie left Electrical toward Security at T4 \u2014 I saw that myself, which matches what Diana says about seeing Charlie enter Security at T6 from that side (2 tick travel, checks out).\n\nHere's the key point Charlie is leaving out: when Charlie left at T4, Alice was alive AND I was still there \u2014 so by Charlie's logic, Charlie is also \"the last person seen with Alice.\" We both were. I left Electrical back to Medbay after T5, then went to Storage where Eve saw me passing through medbay at T7.\n\nBut think about the timing. Eve reports finding Alice's body in Electrical. If I had killed Alice in Electrical and walked back through Medbay, Eve would have walked into Medbay right after me and then continued to Electrical to find the body. That's a very tight window. The alternative: Charlie went Electrical -> Security -> ??? Charlie could have doubled back, or someone else entered Electrical from cafeteria after I left.\n\nI'm not fully clearing Charlie, but I'm also not the obvious answer here. Eve, can you confirm \u2014 was Alice's body fresh, or had it been there a while? And did you pass through Electrical's other entrance? I want to hear Charlie account for ticks 7-9."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388753.372697, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I can confirm I entered Electrical from Medbay, not the cafeteria side. I don\u2019t have a freshness indicator \u2014 I just walked in, saw Alice\u2019s body already down in Electrical, and reported immediately.\n\nThe timing I can confirm is Frank leaving Medbay toward Storage around T7. That fits his route, but it also means he was coming out of the Electrical/Medbay area shortly before I found Alice. I didn\u2019t see Charlie at all, and Diana\u2019s info puts Charlie in Security/Weapons after leaving Electrical.\n\nSo from my perspective, Frank is still the strongest opportunity: Alice was alive with Charlie and Frank in Electrical, Charlie is seen leaving toward Security, then I see Frank moving away from Medbay before I find the body in Electrical. I\u2019m not 100%, but that\u2019s the clearest chain I have."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388782.858271, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I don\u2019t have any direct sightings to add beyond what I already said \u2014 I was upper-left: Upper Engine to Oxygen and back, and I saw nobody.\n\nOn the Electrical kill, the chain that makes the most sense to me is still Frank. Charlie is confirmed leaving toward Security by Diana, and Diana later had Charlie in Weapons. Frank admits he stayed in Electrical after Charlie left, with Alice still alive, then Eve sees Frank moving away from the Medbay/Electrical side shortly before finding the body.\n\nFrank\u2019s \u201ctight window\u201d argument doesn\u2019t really clear him \u2014 killing around T5, leaving through Medbay, then Eve coming in after and finding Alice seems very possible. Someone from cafeteria is technically possible, but we have no evidence for that. Right now I\u2019d lean Frank unless there\u2019s a stronger contradiction."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388805.693831, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I\u2019m still leaning Frank here. My hard info is that Charlie came into Security from Electrical at T6, and later I was with Charlie in Weapons when the meeting got called. For Charlie to double back, kill in Electrical, and still end up in Weapons with me by report timing feels really hard.\n\nFrank admits he stayed in Electrical after Charlie left, with Alice alive, then Eve sees Frank leaving the Medbay/Electrical area shortly before finding Alice dead. That\u2019s the cleanest opportunity chain. I don\u2019t think it\u2019s 100%, but if we\u2019re voting on evidence, Frank is my vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388825.152813, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I want to be very clear on my timing: I left Electrical while Alice was still alive, and Frank was still in there with her. Diana seeing me enter Security at T6 matches me leaving Electrical earlier \u2014 I didn\u2019t double back.\n\nFrank is trying to make it sound like we had equal opportunity, but we didn\u2019t after I left. He admits he stayed in Electrical after me, with Alice alive, then he left through Medbay, and Eve later sees him moving away from that area before finding Alice dead in Electrical.\n\nI also don\u2019t buy the \u201ctight window\u201d defense. Kill in Electrical after I leave, go out through Medbay, Eve comes in shortly after and reports \u2014 that timing works fine. There\u2019s no actual evidence someone came from cafeteria after we left.\n\nSo my strongest read is Frank. Diana can confirm I was away from Electrical after that, and Eve\u2019s sighting lines up with Frank leaving the area."}}
{"timestamp": 1779388839.8989289, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Look, everyone is locking onto me because I'm the most convenient story, but let's actually look at the holes here.\n\nEve's account is the one that bothers me. She says she went storage -> medbay -> electrical, and that she saw me leaving medbay toward storage at T7. But here's the thing: if Eve was in Storage early, then moved to Medbay, she would have been right behind me the entire time. She enters Electrical from Medbay \u2014 the same door I supposedly used \u2014 and conveniently finds the body and reports immediately. That's also a clean setup for a self-report.\n\nConsider: Alice was alive in Electrical when I left back to Medbay. Eve could have entered Electrical from Medbay after I left, killed Alice, and reported. She has the exact same opportunity window you're all assigning to me \u2014 she just got to control the narrative by being the reporter.\n\nI'm not saying it's definitely Eve. But the case against me is \"Frank was in Electrical with Alice and left before the body was found.\" That same sentence applies to Eve, except Eve is the one who found it. Reporters deserve scrutiny too.\n\nIf we're wrong about me, we lose a Goose and the Duck walks free next round. I'd rather we look harder at Eve's route \u2014 specifically, was she actually in Storage at the start, or is that unverifiable? Because nobody has corroborated her early movements at all.\n\nI'm voting Eve."}}
